Acknowledgment
The 2022 Population and Housing Census, conducted under the slogan "Konte Sent Lisi" (Let us count
Saint Lucia), “The Future Is Counting on You” was primarily funded by the Government and People
of Saint Lucia and the World Bank. Additional financial and technical support was provided by
development partners, including the United Nations Economic Commission for Latin America and the
Caribbean (UNECLAC) and the United Nations Population Fund (UNFPA).
The Director of Statistics is grateful to the Government and people of Saint Lucia, the World Bank,
